ngzeb was appointed as the Subedar of the Deccan, the city of &lsquo;Fatehpur&rsquo; was renamed as &lsquo;Aurangabad&rsquo;. In which year did this happen?<br />\n&lsquo;औरंगजेबाची दक्षिणेचा सुभेदार म्हणून नियुक्ती झाल्यानंतर &lsquo;फतेपूर&rsquo; या शहराचे नामांतर &lsquo;औरंगाबाद&rsquo; असे करण्यात आले. हे कोणत्या वर्षी घडले?&rsquo;</p>','<p>1604 (१६०४)</p>','<p>1626 (१६२६)</p>','<p>1653 (१६५३)</p>','<p>1645 (१६४५)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,3,'2025-07-01','13:04:36','2025-07-01 13:04:36',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(122,'<p>The Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar Municipal Corporation was established on 8th December ..........<br />\nछत्रपती संभाजीनगर महानगरपालिकेची स्थापना 8 डिसेंबर ......... रोजी झाली.</p>','<p>1982 (१९८२)</p>','<p>1980 (१९८०)</p>','<p>1984 (१९८४)</p>','<p>1986 (१९८६)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,3,'2025-07-01','13:05:29','2025-07-01 13:05:29',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(123,'<p>Which of the following type of agriculture was introduced in India by the British?<br />\nशेतीचा खालीलपैकी कोणता प्रकार ब्रिटीशांनी भारतात रुजविला?</p>','<p>Jhum (झुम)</p>','<p>Irrigated farming (बागायती)</p>','<p>Plantation farming (मळेशेती)</p>','<p>Intensive farming (सखोल शेती)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,3,'2025-07-01','13:06:34','2025-07-01 13:06:34',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(124,'<p>The separation between the Earth&#39;s crust and the mantle is called ..........<br />\nपृथ्वीचे भूकवच आणि मध्यावरण यांच्या दरम्यान .......... ही विलगता आढळते.</p>','<p>Mohorovicic (मोहोरव्हिसीक)</p>','<p>Gutenberg (गटेनबर्ग)</p>','<p>Wiechert (विचर्ट)</p>','<p>Geophysical (भूभौतिक)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,3,'2025-07-01','13:07:46','2025-07-01 13:07:46',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(125,'<p>Which city in South Africa is known as the &lsqu