id to Tansen, &quot;will you take me to him.&quot;<br />\n(b) Akbar said to Tansen, &quot;Will you take me to him?&quot;<br />\n(c) Akbar said to Tansen, &quot;Will you take me to him.&quot;<br />\n(d) akbar said to tansen, &quot;Will you take me to him?&quot;</p>','<p>Only a and c</p>','<p>Only b</p>','<p>Only c and d</p>','<p>Only d</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:17:27','2025-07-01 16:17:27',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(235,'<p>Identify the correct active form for<br /><strong>&#39;Where will these prisoners be sent?&#39;</strong><br />\na. Where will these prisoners to be sent?<br />\nb. Where will they send these prisoners?<br />\nc. Where these prisoners will be sent?<br />\nd. Where they will send these prisoners?<br /><strong>Which of the above alternatives is/are correct?</strong></p>','<p>a and b only</p>','<p>c and d only</p>','<p>d only</p>','<p>b only</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:18:01','2025-07-01 16:18:01',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(236,'<p><strong>None of us knew the way. </strong><br />\nWhich one of the following is the correct Tag question corresponding to the sentence above?<br />\n(a) didn&#39;t we?<br />\n(b) did we?<br />\n(c) did none?<br />\n(d) did none of us?</p>','<p>(d) only</p>','<p>(a) only</p>','<p>(b) only</p>','<p>(c) only</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:18:34','2025-07-01 16:18:34',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(237,'<p>Identify the sentence with the mood different from that of remaining sentences.</p>','<p>Roshan goes to college regularly.</p>','<p>Roshan writes legibly and speedily.</p>','<p>Roshan, are you okay?</p>','<p>Roshan, open your notebook.</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:19:01','2025-07-01 16:19:01',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(238,'<p>Identify adverb clauses out of the sentences given below.<br />\na. They lost the election because the voters did not trust them.<br />\nb. They rewarded the man who rescued their son.<br />\nc. The play flopped in the way that the critics had predicted.</p>','<p>c only</p>','<p>a and c only</p>','<p>b and c only</p>','<p>a, b and c</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:19:30','2025-07-01 16:19:30',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(239,'<p>You have to catch the train. You must leave immediately.<br />\nCombine the two sentences to make a compound sentence</p>','<p>You must leave immediately in order to catch the train.</p>','<p>If you don&#39;t leave immediately, you won&#39;t catch the train.</p>','<p>If you have to catch the train, you must leave immediately.</p>','<p>You have to catch the train; hence you must leave immediately.</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:20:08','2025-07-01 16:20:08',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(240,'<p>It was too hot to go out.<br />\nChoose the alternative to remove &#39;too&#39;.</p>','<p>It was so hot that one cannot go out.</p>','<p>It was hot to go out.</p>','<p>It was not possible to go out.</p>','<p>None of these.</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:20:42','2025-07-01 16:20:42',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(241,'<p>Choose the correct sentence/s:<br />\n(a) Scarcely anyone turned up, did they?<br />\n(b) Scarcely no one turned up.</p>','<p>Only (a) is correct</p>','<p>Ony (b) is correct</p>','<p>Both (a) and (b) are correct</p>','<p>Both (a) and (b) are incorrect</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:21:18','2025-07-01 16:21:18',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(242,'<p>Choose correct sentence in indirect speech of the given sentence.<br />\nThe Sub-inspector told the constable, &quot;You shall do extra duty for three days.&quot;</p>','<p>The Sub-inspector told the constable You should do extra duty for three days.</p>','<p>The Sub-inspector told the constable that he should do extra duty for three days.</p>','<p>The Sub-inspector told the constable that he shall do extra duty for three days.</p>','<p>The Sub-inspector asked the constable that he shall do extra duty for three days.</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:21:47','2025-07-01 16:21:47',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(243,'<p>Don&#39;t lose your temper.<br />\nRewrite as an affirmative sentence.</p>','<p>Keep silence</p>','<p>Calm &amp; quite</p>','<p>Keep calm</p>','<p>Keep away your temper</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:22:18','2025-07-01 16:22:18',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(244,'<p>Identify the voice of the following sentences from options given below :<br />\na. Do not insult the poor.<br />\nb. Let the poor be not insulted.</p>','<p>a-Passive voice, b-Active voice</p>','<p>a-Active voice, b-Passive voice</p>','<p>both a and b are in Active voice</p>','<p>both a and b are in Passive voice</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:22:48','2025-07-01 16:22:48',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(245,'<p>Fill in the blanks with correct articles.<br />\n(a) ...... apples are grown in many different countries.<br />\n(b) ...... apples on our tree are not yet ripe.</p>','<p>The, no article</p>','<p>The, the</p>','<p>No article, the</p>','<p>An, the</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:23:24','2025-07-01 16:23:24',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(246,'<p>If the series 4, 5, 8, 13, 14, 17, 22 continues in the same way, which of the following numbers will not be part of this series?<br />\nजर 4, 5, 8, 13, 14, 17, 22.... ही मालिका अशीच सुरू ठेवली तर खालीलपैकी कोणती संख्या ही मालिकेची राहणार नाही?</p>','<p>31 (३१)</p>','<p>32 (३२)</p>','<p>33 (३३)</p>','<p>35 (३५)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:23:58','2025-07-01 16:23:58',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(247,'<p>A natural number P is multiplied by 11, and then 33 is added to it. The resulting sum is divisible by 9 with no remainder. Find the smallest value of P satisfying these conditions.<br />\nP या नैसर्गिक संख्येला 11 ने गुणून त्यात 33 ही संख्या मिळवली या बेरजेला 9 ने भागले आणि बाकी शून्य मिळाली. दिलेल्या अटीचे समाधान करणारी P ची सर्वात लहान किंमत निवडा?<br />\n<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n','<p>15 (१५)</p>\n','<p>6 (६)</p>\n','<p>3 (३)</p>\n','<p>1 (१)</p>\n','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:24:30','2025-07-01 16:24:30',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(248,'<p>Two numbers are 6x and 8x, and their HCF is 14 and LCM is 168. What is the value of x?<br />\n&nbsp;दोन संख्या 6x आणि 8x असून त्यांचा मासावी 14 आणि लासावी 168 आहे. तर x ची किंमत किती?</p>','<p>14 (१४)</p>','<p>7 (७)</p>','<p>21 (२१)</p>','<p>28 (२८)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:25:10','2025-07-01 16:25:10',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(249,'<p>Each student of a class donates an amount equal to the number of students in the class towards charity. One student gave 2 rupees more than this amount, making the total contribution 443 rupees. How many students are there in the class?<br />\nधर्मार्थ कार्यासाठी वर्गातील प्रत्येक विद्यार्थी वर्गातील विद्यार्थ्यांच्या संख्येइतकी रक्कम देतो. एका विद्यार्थ्याने 2 रुपयांनी अधिक दिल्यामुळे एकूण वर्गणी 443 रुपये झाली. तर वर्गात किती विद्यार्थी आहेत?</p>\n','<p>12 (१२)</p>\n','<p>21 (२१)</p>\n','<p>43 (४३)</p>\n','<p>45 (४५)</p>\n','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:25:40','2025-07-01 16:25:40',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(250,'<p>In an exam, a student scores 4 marks for each correct answer and loses 1 mark for each wrong answer. He attempted all 60 questions and secured a total of 130 marks. How many questions did he answer correctly?<br />\nएका परीक्षेत विद्यार्थी प्रत्येक अचूक उत्तरासाठी 4 गुण मिळवतो आणि चुकीच्या उत्तरासाठी 1 गुण कापला जातो. जर त्याने सर्व 60 प्रश्न सोडवले आणि 130 गुण मिळवले, तर त्याने किती प्रश्न अचूक सोडवले?<br />\n<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n','<p>35 (३५)</p>\n','<p>38 (३८)</p>\n','<p>63 (६३)</p>\n','<p>81 (८१)</p>\n','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:26:10','2025-07-01 16:26:10',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(251,'<p>The present age ratio of Asha and Usha is 3:4. After 5 years, the ratio of their ages will be 4:5. What are their present ages respectively?<br />\nआशा आणि उषा यांच्या आजच्या वयाचे गुणोत्तर 3:4 आहे. 5 वर्षानंतर त्यांच्या वयाचे गुणोत्तर 4:5 होईल, तर आशा आणि उषा यांचे अनुक्रमे आजचे वय किती?</p>','<p>15, 20 वर्षे (१५, २० वर्षे)</p>','<p>20, 15 वर्षे (२०, १५ वर्षे)</p>','<p>25, 20 वर्षे (२५, २० वर्षे)</p>','<p>20, 25 वर्षे (२०, २५ वर्षे)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:26:53','2025-07-01 16:26:53',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(252,'<p>A train covers a distance of 480 km at a uniform speed. If its speed is reduced by 8 km/h, it takes 3 hours more to cover the same distance. What is the original speed of the train?<br />\nएक रेल्वेगाडी ४८० किमी अंतर एकसमान वेगाने धावते. रेल्वेगाडीचा वेग ८ किमी प्रतितास कमी असल्यास तेच अंतर पूर्ण करण्यास तिला ३ तास जास्त वेळ लागतो. तर रेल्वेगाडीचा मूळ वेग किती असेल?</p>\n','<p>40 km/h (४० किमी/तास)</p>\n','<p>48 km/h (४८ किमी/तास)</p>\n','<p>36 km/h (३६ किमी/तास)</p>\n','<p>32 km/h (३२ किमी/तास)</p>\n','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:27:49','2025-07-01 16:27:49',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(253,'<p>Mr. Ganesh goes to work at an average speed of 48 km/h. The time taken to cover the first 60% of the distance is 10 minutes more than the time taken to cover the remaining distance. What is the total distance to his office?<br />\nसरासरी ४८ किमी/तास या वेगाने श्री. गणेश कामावर जातात. पहिले ६०% अंतर कापण्यास लागणारा वेळ उरलेले अंतर कापण्यास लागणाऱ्या वेळेपेक्षा १० मिनिटे जास्त आहे. त्याचे कार्यालय किती दूर आहे?</p>','<p>48 km (४८ किमी)</p>','<p>45 km (४५ किमी)</p>','<p>40 km (४० किमी)</p>','<p>none of these (यापैकी नाही)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:28:26','2025-07-01 16:28:26',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(254,'<p>A military camp had rations for 1000 soldiers for one month. After 10 days, 1000 more soldiers arrived. How long will the remaining rations last for all the soldiers?<br />\nएका लष्करी तळावर १००० सैनिकांसाठी एका महिन्याची रसद उपलब्ध होती. १० दिवसांनंतर आणखी १००० सैनिक तळावर दाखल झाले. शिल्लक रसदीवर उरलेल्या सर्व सैनिकांना आणखी किती दिवस निभावता येईल?</p>','<p>25 दिवस (२५ दिवस)</p>','<p>20 दिवस (२० दिवस)</p>','<p>15 दिवस (१५ दिवस)</p>','<p>10 दिवस (१० दिवस)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:29:12','2025-07-01 16:29:12',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(255,'<p>Ganu can complete a work in 15 days. If Monu is 50% more efficient than Ganu, then in how many days can both of them together complete the work?<br />\nगणु एखादे काम १५ दिवसात पूर्ण करतो. जर मोनु हा गणूपेक्षा ५०% जास्त कार्यक्षम असेल, तर ते दोघे मिळून ते काम किती दिवसात पूर्ण करतील?</p>','<p>18 दिवस (१८ दिवस)</p>','<p>10 दिवस (१० दिवस)</p>','<p>8 दिवस (८ दिवस)</p>','<p>6 दिवस (६ दिवस)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:29:44','2025-07-01 16:29:44',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(256,'<p>In an exam, 70% of students passed in English, 65% passed in Mathematics, and 25% failed in both subjects. If 3000 students passed in both subjects, what was the total number of students who appeared for the exam?<br />\nएका परीक्षेत ७०% विद्यार्थी इंग्रजीत उत्तीर्ण झाले, ६५% विद्यार्थी गणितात उत्तीर्ण झाले, २५% विद्यार्थी दोन्ही विषयात अनुत्तीर्ण झाले. जर ३००० विद्यार्थी दोन्ही विषयात उत्तीर्ण झाले असतील, तर एकूण किती विद्यार्थ्यांनी परीक्षा दिली?</p>\n','<p>8000 (८०००)</p>\n','<p>6000 (६०००)</p>\n','<p>5000 (५०००)</p>\n','<p>7500 (७५००)</p>\n','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:30:25','2025-07-01 16:30:25',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(257,'<p>In an election, 8% of voters did not vote. There were only two candidates. The elected candidate got 48% of the total votes and defeated the other candidate by 1100 votes. What was the total number of voters?<br />\nएका निवडणुकीत ८% मतदारांनी मतदान केले नाही. या निवडणुकीत फक्त दोनच उमेदवार होते. निवडून आलेल्या उमेदवाराला एकूण मतांच्या ४८% मते मिळाली आणि त्याने ११०० मतांनी दुसऱ्या उमेदवाराचा पराभव केला. तर एकूण मतदार किती होते?</p>','<p>21,000 (२१,०००)</p>','<p>22,000 (२२,०००)</p>','<p>23,000 (२३,०००)</p>','<p>27,500 (२७,५००)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:30:57','2025-07-01 16:30:57',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(258,'<p>A person bought a fridge worth ₹22,800 at 12.5% annual interest. He paid ₹8,650 at the end of the first year, ₹9,125 at the end of the second year. How much should he pay at the end of the third year to settle the loan?<br />\nएका व्यक्तीने ₹२२,८०० किमतीचा एक फ्रीज १२.५% वार्षिक व्याजदराने खरेदी केला. त्याने पहिल्या वर्षाच्या शेवटी ₹८,६५० आणि दुसऱ्या वर्षाच्या शेवटी ₹९,१२५ रुपये भरले. तर तिसऱ्या वर्षाच्या शेवटी सर्व रक्कम फेडण्यासाठी त्याला आणखी किती रुपये भरावे लागतील?</p>','<p>₹10,000 (₹१०,०००)</p>','<p>₹11,250 (₹११,२५०)</p>','<p>₹10,590 (₹१०,५९०)</p>','<p>₹9,990 (₹९,९९०)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:31:32','2025-07-01 16:31:32',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(259,'<p>Ajay and Amit invested ₹1,50,000 and ₹2,50,000 respectively in a business. At the end of the year, the business earned a profit of ₹1,60,000. How much more profit did Amit get compared to Ajay?<br />\nअजयने आणि अमितने एका व्यवसायात अनुक्रमे ₹१,५०,००० आणि ₹२,५०,००० गुंतवले. वर्षाअखेरीस या व्यवसायात ₹१,६०,००० नफा झाला. तर अमितला नफ्यात अजयपेक्षा किती रुपये जास्त मिळाले?</p>','<p>₹40,000 (₹४०,०००)</p>','<p>₹20,000 (₹२०,०००)</p>','<p>₹10,000 (₹१०,०००)</p>','<p>₹6,000 (₹६,०००)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:32:05','2025-07-01 16:32:05',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(260,'<p>The average monthly salary of all employees in a company is ₹5,000. The average salary of male and female employees is ₹5,200 and ₹4,200 respectively. What is the percentage of male employees in the company?<br />\nकंपनीच्या सर्व कर्मचाऱ्यांना दिलेले मासिक सरासरी वेतन ₹५,००० होते. पुरुष व महिला कर्मचाऱ्यांचे मासिक सरासरी वेतन अनुक्रमे ₹५,२०० आणि ₹४,२०० होते. तर कंपनीतील पुरुष कर्मचाऱ्यांची टक्केवारी किती?</p>','<p>75% (७५%)</p>','<p>90% (९०%)</p>','<p>85% (८५%)</p>','<p>80% (८०%)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:32:41','2025-07-01 16:32:41',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(261,'<p>Ajay bought 30 kg of rice at ₹11.50 per kg and 20 kg of rice at ₹14.25 per kg. After mixing the two types of rice, at what price per kg should he sell the mixture to gain 30% profit?<br />\nअजयने ३० किलो तांदूळ ₹११.५० प्रती किलो या दराने, आणि २० किलो तांदूळ ₹१४.२५ प्रती किलो या दराने खरेदी केला. दोन्ही तांदळांचे मिश्रण करून, जर त्याला ३०% नफा कमवायचा असेल, तर त्या मिश्रणाची किंमत प्रती किलो किती ठेवावी लागेल?</p>','<p>₹14.80 (₹१४.८०)</p>','<p>₹15.60 (₹१५.६०)</p>','<p>₹16.38 (₹१६.३८)</p>','<p>none of these (यापैकी नाही)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:33:16','2025-07-01 16:33:16',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(262,'<p>If 2 letters are chosen at random from the word <strong>&ldquo;reasoning&rdquo;</strong>, what is the probability that one of them is a vowel and the other is a consonant?<br />\n&ldquo;reasoning&rdquo; या शब्दामधून २ अक्षरे निवडली असता, त्या २ अक्षरांपैकी एक स्वर आणि एक व्यंजन असण्याची संभाव्यता किती?</p>','<p>5/9 (५/९)</p>','<p>28/55 (२८/५५)</p>','<p>2/11 (२/११)</p>','<p>6/55 (६/५५)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:34:04','2025-07-01 16:34:04',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(263,'<p>A box contains coins worth ₹900, consisting of 50-paise and 25-paise coins in the ratio 2:5. What is the total value of the 25-paise coins?<br />\nएका बॉक्समध्ये ९०० रुपये आहेत. त्यात ५० पैसे आणि २५ पैशांची नाणी २:५ या प्रमाणात आहेत. तर त्यातील २५ पैशांच्या नाण्यांची एकूण किंमत किती असेल?</p>','<p>300 rupees (३०० रुपये)</p>','<p>400 rupees (४०० रुपये)</p>','<p>500 rupees (५०० रुपये)</p>','<p>600 rupees (६०० रुपये)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','c','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:34:58','2025-07-01 16:34:58',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(264,'<p>The sum of the ages of four sisters 5 years ago was 80 years. What will be the sum of their ages after 15 years?<br />\nचार बहीणींच्या ५ वर्षांपूर्वीच्या वयाची बेरीज ८० वर्षे होती, तर १५ वर्षांनंतर त्यांच्या वयाची बेरीज किती होईल?</p>','<p>60 (६०)</p>','<p>100 (१००)</p>','<p>140 (१४०)</p>','<p>160 (१६०)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:35:45','2025-07-01 16:35:45',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(265,'<p>What is the angle between the hour and minute hands of a clock at 3:40?<br />\nघड्याळावर ३:४० वाजता तास काटा व मिनिट काट्यातील कोन किती असेल?</p>','<p>130&deg; (१३०&deg;)</p>','<p>135&deg; (१३५&deg;)</p>','<p>150&deg; (१५०&deg;)</p>','<p>125&deg; (१२५&deg;)</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:37:03','2025-07-01 16:37:03',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(266,'<p>KcbS, LeeT, MghU, NikV, _____?</p>','<p>oKnW</p>','<p>OpnV</p>','<p>OkNw</p>','<p>OknW</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:37:43','2025-07-01 16:37:43',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(267,'<p>In a certain code language, the word <strong>GOVERN</strong> is written as <strong>hnwdsm</strong>, then what does <strong>qqpejkt</strong> mean?<br />\nएका सांकेतिक भाषेत GOVERN हा शब्द hnwdsm असा लिहिला, तर qqpejkt म्हणजे काय ?</p>','<p>RRQDKJU</p>','<p>PROFILS</p>','<p>RPQCKJU</p>','<p>PROGRESS</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','b','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:38:19','2025-07-01 16:38:19',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(268,'<p>If <strong>GO = 4</strong>, <strong>BIG = 9</strong>, <strong>BULL = 16</strong>, then what is the value of <strong>CROWN</strong>?<br />\nजर GO = 4, BIG = 9, BULL 16, तर CROWN = किती ?</p>','<p>25</p>','<p>36</p>','<p>16</p>','<p>49</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','a','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:39:15','2025-07-01 16:39:15',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(269,'<p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></p>','<p>T</p>','<p>N</p>','<p>P</p>','<p>Q</p>','',NULL,'0',1,'','0','0','d','','0','3',1,'1',0,4,'2025-07-01','16:40:37','2025-07-01 16:40:37',0,'','',0,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-06 10:00:35','2025-10-06 10:00:37'),(270,'<p>Study the given codes below and suggest the correct symbolic form for the requested word.<br />\nखाली दिलेल्या संकेतांचा अभ्यास करा व विचारलेल्या शब्दांसाठी योग्य सांकेतिक रुप सुचवा.<br />\n<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /><br />\n<strong>MUTINY = ?</strong></p>\